{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title_batch02","type":"text","text":"# 女性发型库总表｜主要类型真实参考批次 02\n\n**新增 8 个主要家族，24 张 Wikimedia Commons 真实参考图**\n\n丸子头／编发／半扎／盘发／长直发／特殊断层剪裁／剃短非对称／自然纹理与保护性发型。\n\n与批次 01 合并后，已覆盖角色设计中最常用的主要女性发型结构。图片使用 Commons 稳定重定向，并保留文件页与许可。","x":-600,"y":-900,"width":1200,"height":520,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group_bun_batch02","type":"group","x":-3900,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"丸子头／发髻｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_bun_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 经典丸子头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Bun%20hairstyle.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bun%20hairstyle.jpg)","x":-3840,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_bun_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 低位发髻／Chignon\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Bun.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bun.jpg)","x":-3280,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_bun_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 松散丸子头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Loose%20bun.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Loose%20bun.jpg)","x":-2720,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"summary_bun_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 丸子头／发髻结构定义\n\n盘成团块的一处或多处固定体。主变量：高低、紧松、单丸／双丸、是否编织。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":-3840,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group_braid_batch02","type":"group","x":-1950,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"1","label":"编发／辫发｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_braid_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 长编发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20long%20braided%20hair.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20long%20braided%20hair.JPG)","x":-1890,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_braid_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 鱼骨辫\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Fishtail%20Braid.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fishtail%20Braid.JPG)","x":-1330,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_braid_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 复杂编织\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Hairstyle%20-%20intricate%20braid.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hairstyle%20-%20intricate%20braid.jpg)","x":-770,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"summary_braid_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 编发／辫发结构定义\n\n发束按重复交叉规则组织。主变量：三股／鱼骨／绳辫／多股、单辫／双辫／贴头编。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":-1890,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"group_halfup_batch02","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"3","label":"半扎发｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_halfup_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 半扎半披\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Half-up%20half-down%20hairdo.png?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Half-up%20half-down%20hairdo.png)","x":60,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"img_halfup_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 半马尾\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Half%20Ponytail.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Half%20Ponytail.JPG)","x":620,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"img_halfup_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 扭转半扎近邻\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Hairstyles%20twist.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hairstyles%20twist.jpg)","x":1180,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"summary_halfup_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 半扎发结构定义\n\n上半区被固定，下半区保持自由披落。需与全马尾、全盘发区分。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":60,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"group_updo_batch02","type":"group","x":1950,"y":0,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"2","label":"盘发／法式扭转｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_updo_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 经典法式扭转\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Frenchtwist.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Frenchtwist.jpg)","x":2010,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img_updo_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 法式扭转细节\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/French%20Twist%20Close-up%201.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:French%20Twist%20Close-up%201.JPG)","x":2570,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img_updo_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 编织低盘发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Hair%20in%20bun.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hair%20in%20bun.JPG)","x":3130,"y":120,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"summary_updo_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 盘发／法式扭转结构定义\n\n将长度收纳到后脑或后颈，形成卷、折、塞、绕的封闭体。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":2010,"y":1010,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"group_long_batch02","type":"group","x":-3900,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"6","label":"长直发／超长发｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_long_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 长直金发后视\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20long%2C%20straight%20blond%20hair%20from%20behind.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20long%2C%20straight%20blond%20hair%20from%20behind.jpg)","x":-3840,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img_long_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 长直棕发后视\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20long%2C%20straight%20light%20brown%20hair%20from%20behind.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20long%2C%20straight%20light%20brown%20hair%20from%20behind.jpg)","x":-3280,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img_long_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 超长发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Woman%20with%20very%20long%20hair.JPG?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman%20with%20very%20long%20hair.JPG)","x":-2720,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"summary_long_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 长直发／超长发结构定义\n\n长度层：胸下、腰长、臀长及以上。主变量：齐切／层次、直／波、重量线与发梢形状。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":-3840,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"group_specialcut_batch02","type":"group","x":-1950,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"5","label":"特殊断层剪裁｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_specialcut_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 现代鲻鱼头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Modern%20Mullet.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Modern%20Mullet.jpg)","x":-1890,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_specialcut_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 现代彩色鲻鱼\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Jay%20Jo%20mullet.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jay%20Jo%20mullet.jpg)","x":-1330,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"img_specialcut_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 不对称波波头\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Asymmetrical%20bob%20%2851210139996%29.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Asymmetrical%20bob%20%2851210139996%29.jpg)","x":-770,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"summary_specialcut_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 特殊断层剪裁结构定义\n\n通过前短后长、左右不等或强断层制造非连续轮廓；与普通层次发分开。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":-1890,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group_undercut_batch02","type":"group","x":0,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"4","label":"剃短／非对称｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_undercut_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 女性侧分 Undercut\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Undercut%20%2820048891914%29.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Undercut%20%2820048891914%29.jpg)","x":60,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"img_undercut_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 长不对称 Bob\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Long%20asymmetrical%20bob%20with%20layers%2011.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Long%20asymmetrical%20bob%20with%20layers%2011.jpg)","x":620,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"img_undercut_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### 剃光头／极短轮廓\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Shorn%20woman%20in%20white.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shorn%20woman%20in%20white.jpg)","x":1180,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"summary_undercut_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 剃短／非对称结构定义\n\n一侧或局部极短、另一侧保留长度；也包含全剃或极短轮廓这一基础家族。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":60,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group_natural_batch02","type":"group","x":1950,"y":1900,"width":1750,"height":1650,"color":"1","label":"自然纹理／保护性发型｜主要家族"},
		{"id":"img_natural_1_batch02","type":"text","text":"### Afro 自然蓬发\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Afro%20Hair.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Afro%20Hair.jpg)","x":2010,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_natural_2_batch02","type":"text","text":"### Cornrows 贴头辫\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Cornrows.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cornrows.jpg)","x":2570,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"img_natural_3_batch02","type":"text","text":"### Locs／脏辫\n\n![](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Dreadlock%20Lady.jpg?width=900)\n\n[打开 Wikimedia 来源与许可](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dreadlock%20Lady.jpg)","x":3130,"y":2020,"width":500,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"summary_natural_batch02","type":"text","text":"## 自然纹理／保护性发型结构定义\n\n必须独立保留：自然卷体量、贴头编织与锁状发束不是‘普通卷发的小变体’。\n\n**判断规则**：只按可见发束组织、固定点、长度轮廓、纹理和剪裁关系归类。","x":2010,"y":2910,"width":1610,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"coverage_batch02","type":"text","text":"# 主要类型覆盖审计\n\n## 已覆盖的 15 个一级家族\n1. 刘海（专项 98 种）\n2. 马尾\n3. 短发\n4. 卷发\n5. 公主切\n6. 双马尾\n7. 狼尾／狼剪\n8. 丸子头／发髻\n9. 编发／辫发\n10. 半扎发\n11. 盘发／法式扭转\n12. 长直发／超长发\n13. 特殊断层剪裁（鲻鱼／不对称）\n14. 剃短／Undercut／光头\n15. 自然纹理与保护性发型（Afro／Cornrows／Locs）\n\n## 仍可作为三级专题扩展\n双丸子、水母头、蝴蝶剪、章鱼剪、法式 Bob、Box Braids、Twists、Bantu Knots、古典盘髻、民族发式、未来机械发型。\n\n这批已经能囊括主流角色库的一级分类，后续应做子型深挖，而不是再无限制造同义大类。","x":-600,"y":3850,"width":1200,"height":1000,"color":"4"}
	],
